        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Immortal Gu Mutual Sense allows two parties to sense each other’s situation. Linked with Fang Zheng through blood sense Gu, Fang Yuan senses the blood pool, Fang Zheng’s body, failed blood demon flowers, a spirit incubating flea, and the Mutual Sense Gu above, while Fang Zheng can only see through Fang Yuan’s eyes with limited perception and cannot sense Fang Yuan’s immortal aperture. Fang Yuan tells Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan that the other side used his brother and Mutual Sense to get his location.",
        "chapters": [
          699
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
